{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magicians of Multiplication Island </strong>is an educational fantasy role-playing game designed to help players master multiplication tables through engaging gameplay. You take on missions across a monster-infested island, banishing creatures by correctly solving multiplication problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond casting banishment spells, you'll meet intriguing characters, step through teleportation portals, and explore locations like the Healer's shack and the Inn. Collect pieces of a magical necklace that grants access to a mystical desert, hitch rides on airships, and use healing or magical potions to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture deeper into the island, the challenges grow. The monsters in the forest, for example, are tougher\u2014but so are the rewards. Ultimately, your path leads to the dark castle, a final test filled with fearsome demons that will challenge both your courage and your multiplication skills.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872280?t=1758890384","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872280/6fb139bd17ec4463196cbeb4b5cd16bd27f3f01a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758890384","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872280/47793fdd5671d878daa4f898361ef1e20728d189/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758890384","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872280/47793fdd5671d878daa4f898361ef1e20728d189/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758890384","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magicians of Multiplication Island </strong>is an educational fantasy role-playing game designed to help players master multiplication tables through engaging gameplay. You take on missions across a monster-infested island, banishing creatures by correctly solving multiplication problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond casting banishment spells, you'll meet intriguing characters, step through teleportation portals, and explore locations like the Healer's shack and the Inn. Collect pieces of a magical necklace that grants access to a mystical desert, hitch rides on airships, and use healing or magical potions to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture deeper into the island, the challenges grow. The monsters in the forest, for example, are tougher\u2014but so are the rewards. Ultimately, your path leads to the dark castle, a final test filled with fearsome demons that will challenge both your courage and your multiplication skills.</p>","developers":["Spacey Games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872280/25067c1d90c3c94106dac0c9ea4be12f5a04ef06/header.jpg?t=1758890384","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Magicians of Multiplication Island","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Spacey Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full"